new.prompt_tags_instruction:
This is a prompt for an image:
{PROMPT}

List the physical things the prompt names that could be pointed at in the image: objects, people, animals, plants, clothing, materials, buildings and parts of the scene. Use short lowercase noun phrases of one to four words, separated by commas. Keep each thing's own descriptive words, such as its color. Leave out places and settings, actions, sizes, moods, the image's style, medium, quality, camera and lighting, artist names and position words. List each thing once. Output only the list.

